*Logical and Bitwise Operators* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

*Logical Operators*

''and'' - Logical AND (short-circuit: returns left if falsy, otherwise right)
''or'' - Logical OR (short-circuit: returns left if truthy, otherwise right)
''not'' - Logical NOT (returns ''true'' if falsy, ''false'' if truthy)
''xor'' - Logical XOR (returns ''true'' if exactly one operand is truthy)

'''
var a = true and false;   # 0
var r = true or false;    # 1
var c = not false;        # 1
var d = true xor true;    # 0
'''

*Bitwise Operators*

''band'' - Bitwise AND
''bor'' - Bitwise OR
''bnot'' - Bitwise NOT (complement)
''bxor'' - Bitwise XOR
''<<'' - Left shift
''>>'' - Right shift

Non integer operands on bitwise operators will cause a runtime error.

'''
var a = 5 band 3;           # 1
var r = 5 bor 3;            # 7
var c = 5 bxor 3;           # 6
var d = bnot 0;             # -1
var e = 255 band bnot 8;    # 247 (clear bit 3)
var f = 1 << 4;             # 16
var g = 256 >> 3;           # 32
'''

*Common Patterns*

Clear a flag: ''value band bnot flag''
Set a flag: ''value bor flag''
Toggle a flag: ''value bxor flag''
Check a flag: ''value band flag'' (non-zero means set)
Create a flag mask: ''1 << n''

*Precedence (low to high)*

''and'', ''or'', ''xor''
''band'', ''bor'', ''bxor''
''not'', comparisons
''<<'', ''>>''
''+'', ''-''
''*'', ''/'', ''%''
''bnot'', unary ''+''/''-''
''^''
